  {
    "start": "00:01:16.635",
    "end": "00:01:18.315",
    "start_seconds": 76.635,
    "end_seconds": 78.315,
    "text": "Station that doesn't help you make a"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:18.315",
    "end": "00:01:19.725",
    "start_seconds": 78.315,
    "end_seconds": 79.725,
    "text": "Snickers bar, doesn't it help you even"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:19.725",
    "end": "00:01:21.165",
    "start_seconds": 79.725,
    "end_seconds": 81.16499999999999,
    "text": "understand what a Snickers bar is?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:21.225",
    "end": "00:01:22.755",
    "start_seconds": 81.225,
    "end_seconds": 82.755,
    "text": "Everything has a beginning,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:22.785",
    "end": "00:01:23.655",
    "start_seconds": 82.785,
    "end_seconds": 83.655,
    "text": "a middle, and an end."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:23.715",
    "end": "00:01:25.305",
    "start_seconds": 83.715,
    "end_seconds": 85.305,
    "text": "My life, as much as I don't"
  },
