    "start": "00:01:40.560",
    "end": "00:01:41.940",
    "start_seconds": 100.56,
    "end_seconds": 101.94,
    "text": "understand how to live a life."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:42.030",
    "end": "00:01:43.920",
    "start_seconds": 102.03,
    "end_seconds": 103.92,
    "text": "Saying that a story has a beginning, a"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:43.920",
    "end": "00:01:45.630",
    "start_seconds": 103.92,
    "end_seconds": 105.63,
    "text": "middle, and an end is a useless piece"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:45.630",
    "end": "00:01:46.980",
    "start_seconds": 105.63,
    "end_seconds": 106.97999999999999,
    "text": "of information that does nothing to"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:46.980",
    "end": "00:01:48.960",
    "start_seconds": 106.97999999999999,
    "end_seconds": 108.96000000000001,
    "text": "describe a story, and more importantly,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:48.960",
    "end": "00:01:50.760",
    "start_seconds": 108.96000000000001,
    "end_seconds": 110.75999999999999,
    "text": "it does nothing to help you tell a story,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:52.770",
    "end": "00:01:53.580",
    "start_seconds": 112.77000000000001,
    "end_seconds": 113.58,
    "text": "a story."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:53.985",
    "end": "00:01:56.085",
    "start_seconds": 113.985,
    "end_seconds": 116.08500000000001,
    "text": "Is not a beginning, a middle, and an end."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:01:56.175",
    "end": "00:01:59.145",
    "start_seconds": 116.175,
    "end_seconds": 119.14500000000001,
    "text": "A story is a singular moment in your"
