    "start": "00:02:37.365",
    "end": "00:02:39.825",
    "start_seconds": 157.365,
    "end_seconds": 159.825,
    "text": "And the context that you wrap around"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:39.825",
    "end": "00:02:42.225",
    "start_seconds": 159.825,
    "end_seconds": 162.225,
    "text": "that moment to bring it to the greatest"
  },
