    "start": "00:02:44.115",
    "end": "00:02:45.825",
    "start_seconds": 164.115,
    "end_seconds": 165.825,
    "text": "And that is every single movie you've"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:45.825",
    "end": "00:02:47.655",
    "start_seconds": 165.825,
    "end_seconds": 167.655,
    "text": "ever seen, every TV show you've ever"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:47.655",
    "end": "00:02:49.365",
    "start_seconds": 167.655,
    "end_seconds": 169.365,
    "text": "watched, every book you've ever read, any"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:49.365",
    "end": "00:02:51.255",
    "start_seconds": 169.365,
    "end_seconds": 171.255,
    "text": "play or musical you've seen on the stage,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:02:51.285",
    "end": "00:02:53.745",
    "start_seconds": 171.285,
