    "start": "00:02:59.565",
    "end": "00:03:00.825",
    "start_seconds": 179.565,
    "end_seconds": 180.825,
    "text": "It's just a moment in"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:00.825",
    "end": "00:03:02.535",
    "start_seconds": 180.825,
    "end_seconds": 182.535,
    "text": "time that is amusing and."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:02.780",
    "end": "00:03:05.240",
    "start_seconds": 182.78,
    "end_seconds": 185.24,
    "text": "Silly and delightful, but doesn't have"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:05.240",
    "end": "00:03:07.310",
    "start_seconds": 185.24,
    "end_seconds": 187.31,
    "text": "the stickiness, the unforgettable ness,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:07.310",
    "end": "00:03:09.260",
    "start_seconds": 187.31,
    "end_seconds": 189.26,
    "text": "the staying power, the connectiveness,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:09.440",
    "end": "00:03:11.420",
    "start_seconds": 189.44,
    "end_seconds": 191.42,
    "text": "the relatability of an actual story."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:11.420",
    "end": "00:03:12.470",
    "start_seconds": 191.42,
    "end_seconds": 192.47,
    "text": "They're not bad."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:12.530",
    "end": "00:03:13.490",
    "start_seconds": 192.53,
    "end_seconds": 193.49,
    "text": "They just have to understand."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:13.490",
    "end": "00:03:14.030",
    "start_seconds": 193.49,
    "end_seconds": 194.03,
    "text": "They don't have the"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:14.030",
    "end": "00:03:15.680",
    "start_seconds": 194.03,
    "end_seconds": 195.68,
    "text": "power of an actual story."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:15.980",
    "end": "00:03:17.360",
    "start_seconds": 195.98,
    "end_seconds": 197.36,
    "text": "So when you're thinking about"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:17.360",
    "end": "00:03:18.500",
    "start_seconds": 197.36,
    "end_seconds": 198.5,
    "text": "storytelling and you're thinking"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:18.500",
    "end": "00:03:20.090",
    "start_seconds": 198.5,
    "end_seconds": 200.09,
    "text": "about, I'm gonna craft a story."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:20.135",
    "end": "00:03:21.665",
    "start_seconds": 200.135,
    "end_seconds": 201.665,
    "text": "I'm gonna produce a great story"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:21.665",
    "end": "00:03:23.045",
    "start_seconds": 201.665,
    "end_seconds": 203.04500000000002,
    "text": "for the screen or the stage,"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:23.225",
    "end": "00:03:25.114",
    "start_seconds": 203.225,
    "end_seconds": 205.114,
    "text": "or maybe just on my first date."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:25.265",
    "end": "00:03:26.524",
    "start_seconds": 205.265,
    "end_seconds": 206.524,
    "text": "The last thing you should think"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:26.524",
    "end": "00:03:28.054",
    "start_seconds": 206.524,
    "end_seconds": 208.054,
    "text": "about, the very, very last thing"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:28.054",
    "end": "00:03:29.765",
    "start_seconds": 208.054,
    "end_seconds": 209.765,
    "text": "you should think about is it needs"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:29.765",
    "end": "00:03:31.715",
    "start_seconds": 209.765,
    "end_seconds": 211.715,
    "text": "a beginning, a middle, and an end."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:31.924",
    "end": "00:03:33.845",
    "start_seconds": 211.924,
    "end_seconds": 213.845,
    "text": "Because no matter what you say, no"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:33.845",
    "end": "00:03:35.225",
    "start_seconds": 213.845,
    "end_seconds": 215.225,
    "text": "matter what the length of the thing"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:35.225",
    "end": "00:03:37.625",
    "start_seconds": 215.225,
    "end_seconds": 217.625,
    "text": "you say is, it will always inherently"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:37.625",
    "end": "00:03:39.334",
    "start_seconds": 217.625,
    "end_seconds": 219.334,
    "text": "have a beginning, a middle, and an end."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:39.394",
    "end": "00:03:40.864",
    "start_seconds": 219.394,
    "end_seconds": 220.864,
    "text": "But does that help you in any way?"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:40.864",
    "end": "00:03:41.644",
    "start_seconds": 220.864,
    "end_seconds": 221.644,
    "text": "It doesn't."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:41.704",
    "end": "00:03:43.325",
    "start_seconds": 221.704,
    "end_seconds": 223.325,
    "text": "Everything has a beginning, a"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:43.325",
    "end": "00:03:44.855",
    "start_seconds": 223.325,
    "end_seconds": 224.855,
    "text": "middle, and an end, so it is"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:44.855",
    "end": "00:03:47.105",
    "start_seconds": 224.855,
    "end_seconds": 227.105,
    "text": "stupid, meaningless advice."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:47.145",
    "end": "00:03:48.885",
    "start_seconds": 227.145,
    "end_seconds": 228.885,
    "text": "For crafting better stories."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:48.945",
    "end": "00:03:50.985",
    "start_seconds": 228.945,
    "end_seconds": 230.985,
    "text": "Instead, find a moment."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:51.495",
    "end": "00:03:53.115",
    "start_seconds": 231.495,
    "end_seconds": 233.115,
    "text": "Find a moment that means"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:53.115",
    "end": "00:03:54.705",
    "start_seconds": 233.115,
    "end_seconds": 234.70499999999998,
    "text": "something to you in this world."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:55.005",
    "end": "00:03:57.195",
    "start_seconds": 235.005,
    "end_seconds": 237.195,
    "text": "Wrap the context around that moment"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:57.195",
    "end": "00:03:59.415",
    "start_seconds": 237.195,
    "end_seconds": 239.415,
    "text": "to bring clarity so that the audience"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:03:59.415",
    "end": "00:04:01.245",
    "start_seconds": 239.415,
    "end_seconds": 241.245,
    "text": "understands what you're saying and then"
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:01.245",
    "end": "00:04:03.285",
    "start_seconds": 241.245,
    "end_seconds": 243.285,
    "text": "deliver it in the best possible way."
  },
  {
    "start": "00:04:03.465",
    "end": "00:04:05.385",
    "start_seconds": 243.465,
    "end_seconds": 245.385,
    "text": "That is the way to tell a great story."
  }
]
